INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('davideast/stitch-mcp/typed-service-contracts', 'typed-service-contracts', 'davideast', 'stitch-mcp', 'community', 'typed-service-contracts davideast stitch-mcp community The typed-service-contracts skill enables developers to implement Vertical Slice Architecture with Design by Contract principles, treating application logic as rigorously defined Units of Work. This skill is ideal for building CLIs, libraries, and complex validation systems. typed-service-contracts是一种垂直切片架构，遵循设计合约原则，实现严格的输入解析和错误处理 typed-service-contractsはDesign by Contract原則に基づいたVertical Slice Architectureであり、厳格な入力解析とエラーハンドリングを実現する typed-service-contracts는 디자인 바이 컨트랙트 원칙에 따라 구축된 垂直 슬라이스 아키텍처로 엄격한 입력 파싱과 에러 처리를 제공합니다 Los contratos de servicio tipados ofrecen una arquitectura de slice vertical con principios de diseño por contrato para aplicaciones confiables. Les contrats de service typés proposent une architecture de slice vertical avec des principes de conception par contrat pour des applications fiables. Typisierte Dienstverträge bieten eine vertikale Slice-Architektur mit Design-by-Contract-Prinzipien für zuverlässige Anwendungen. O typed-service-contracts é uma habilidade que define uma arquitetura de fatia vertical com design por contrato Типизированные сервисные контракты - это навык, определяющий вертикальную архитектуру с принципами Design by Contract عقود الخدمة المُصنّفة هي مهارة تعرف هندسة الشريحة الرأسية بالعقد how to use typed-service-contracts typed-service-contracts alternative typed-service-contracts setup guide what is typed-service-contracts typed-service-contracts vs design patterns implementing Vertical Slice Architecture with typed-service-contracts typed-service-contracts for complex validation typed-service-contracts install typed-service-contracts tutorial yped-service-contracts 垂直切片架构 设计合约 输入解析 错误处理 CLI构建 库构建 复杂验证 Implements Vertical Slice Architecture for modular application design Applies Design by Contract principles for rigorous input parsing and error handling Treats application logic as rigorously defined Units of Work with parsed inputs Utilizes the Result Pattern for error handling, treating errors as values rather than exceptions Enforces strict boundaries between user input and system logic for secure and reliable applications Supports complex validation for robust and fault-tolerant systems typed-service-contracts is a skill that defines a Vertical Slice Architecture backed by Design by Contract principles, ensuring strict boundaries and robust error handling in application logic.');
