ff","Testes abrangentes com pytest","Registro estruturado com loguru","Integração com gerenciador uv"],"ru":["Строгая типизация с ty","Унифицированный линтинг с ruff","Комплексное тестирование с pytest","Структурированный логгинг с loguru","Интеграция с менеджером uv для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["التهجين الصارم مع ty","التنسيق الموحد مع ruff","الاختبار الشامل مع pytest","التسجيل المنظم مع loguru","التكامل مع مدير uv لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use MLOps Validation","MLOps Validation setup guide","MLOps Validation vs traditional testing","what is MLOps Validation","MLOps Validation install","MLOps Validation alternative","automated validation in MLOps","MLOps Validation for AI agents","MLOps Validation best practices"],"zh":["MLOps Validation","Python 包","自动化验证","软件质量","可靠性","安全性","AIエージェント","自动化测试"],"ja":["MLOps Validation","AIエージェント","自動検証","ソフトウェア品質","信頼性","セキュリティ","Python パッケージ","自動化テスト"],"ko":["MLOps Validation","Python 패키지","자동화 된 검증","소프트웨어 품질","신뢰성","보안","AI 에이전트","자동화 테스트"],"es":["MLOps Validation","validación de código","calidad de software","seguridad de software","py","ty","ruff","pytest","loguru","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["MLOps Validation","validation de code","qualité de logiciel","sécurité de logiciel","py","ty","ruff","pytest","loguru","développement de logiciel"],"de":["MLOps Validation","Code-Validierung","Software-Qualität","Software-Sicherheit","py","ty","ruff","pytest","loguru","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["MLOps Validation","Desenvolvimento de software com Python","Garantia de qualidade de software","Tipagem rigorosa","Linting unificado","Testes abrangentes","Registro estruturado","Integração com uv"],"ru":["MLOps Validation","Разработка программного обеспечения на Python","Обеспечение качества программного обеспечения ИИ Агентов","Строгая типизация","Унифицированный линтинг","Комплексное тестирование","Структурированный логгинг","Интеграция с менеджером uv"],"ar":["MLOps Validation","تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام بايثون","ضمان جودة البرمجيات لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التهجين الصارم","التنسيق الموحد","الاختبار الشامل","التسجيل المنظم","التكامل مع مدير uv"]}},"owner":"fmind","repo":"mlops-python-package","repoPath":"fmind/mlops-python-package","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.562Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"MLOps Validation","description":"Guide to implement rigorous validation layers including static analysis, automated testing, structured logging, and security scanning.","bodyPreview":"# MLOps Validation\n\n## Goal\n\nTo ensure software quality, reliability, and security through automated validation layers. This skill enforces **Strict Typing** (`ty`), **Unified Linting** (`ruff`), **Comprehensive Testing** (`pytest`), and **Structured Logging** (`loguru`).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Language**: Python\n- **Manager**: `uv`\n- **Context**: Ensuring code quality before merge/deploy.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Static Analysis (Typing & Linting)\n\nCatch errors before they run.\n\n1. **Typing**:","body":"# MLOps Validation\n\n## Goal\n\nTo ensure software quality, reliability, and security through automated validation layers. This skill enforces **Strict Typing** (`ty`), **Unified Linting** (`ruff`), **Comprehensive Testing** (`pytest`), and **Structured Logging** (`loguru`).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Language**: Python\n- **Manager**: `uv`\n- **Context**: Ensuring code quality before merge/deploy.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Static Analysis (Typing & Linting)\n\nCatch errors before they run.\n\n1. **Typing**:\n    - **Tool**: `ty`.\n    - **Rule**: No `Any` (unless absolutely necessary). Fully typed function signatures.\n    - **DataFrames**: Use `pandera` schemas to validate DataFrame structures/types.\n    - **Classes**: Use `pydantic` for data modeling and runtime validation.\n2. **Linting & Formatting**:\n    - **Tool**: `ruff` (replaces black, isort, pylint, flake8).\n    - **Rule**: Zero tolerance for linter errors. Use `noqa` sparingly and with justification.\n    - **Config**: Centralize in `pyproject.toml`.\n\n### 2. Testing Strategy\n\nVerify behavior and prevent regressions.\n\n1. **Tool**: `pytest`.\n2. **Structure**: Mirror `src/` in `tests/`.\n\n    ```text\n    src/pkg/mod.py -> tests/test_mod.py\n    ```\n\n3. **Fixtures**: Use `tests/conftest.py` for shared setup (mock data, temp paths).\n4. **Coverage**: Aim for high coverage (>80%) on core business logic. Use `pytest-cov`.\n5. **Pattern**: Use **Given-When-Then** in comments.\n\n    ```python\n    def test_pipeline_execution(input_data):\n        # Given: Valid input data\n        # When: The pipeline processes the data\n        # Then: The output content matches expectations\n    ```\n\n### 3. Structured Logging\n\nEnable observability and debugging.\n\n1. **Tool**: `loguru` (replacing stdlib `logging`).\n2. **Format**: Use structured logging (JSON) in production for queryability.\n3. **Levels**:\n    - `DEBUG`: Low-level tracing (payloads, internal state).\n    - `INFO`: Key business events (Job started, Model saved).\n    - `ERROR`: Actionable failures (with stack traces).\n4. **Context**: Include context (Job ID, Model Version) in logs.\n\n### 4. Security\n\nProtect the supply chain and runtime.\n\n1. **Dependencies**: Use `GitHub Dependabot` to patch vulnerable packages.\n2. **Code Scanning**: Run `bandit` to detect hardcoded secrets or unsafe patterns (e.g., `eval`, `yaml.load`).\n3. **Secrets**: **NEVER** log secrets. Sanitize outputs.\n\n## Self-Correction Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Type Safety**: Does `ty` pass without errors?\n- [ ] **Lint Cleanliness**: Does `ruff check` pass?\n- [ ] **Test Discovery**: Does `pytest` successfully find modules in `src/`?\n- [ ] **Log Format**: Are production logs serializing to JSON?\n- [ ] **Security**: Has `bandit` scanned the codebase?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:36.826Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing strict typing, unified linting, and comprehensive testing for MLOps validation.","zh":"非常适合需要严格类型、统一lint和全面测试的Python分析代理进行MLOps验证。","ja":"Python分析エージェントが厳格なタイピング、統一されたlint、MLOps検証のための包括的なテストを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":" 엄격한 타이핑,統一된 린트, MLOps 검증을 위한 포괄적인 테스트가 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan tipado estricto, linting unificado y pruebas exhaustivas para la validación de MLOps.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python nécessitant un typage strict, un linting unifié et des tests exhaustifs pour la validation de MLOps.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die strenges Typing, einheitliches Linting und umfassende Tests für die MLOps-Validierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de digitação estrita, linting unificado e teste abrangente para validação de MLOps.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым требуется строгая типизация, унифицированная проверка кода и всестороннее тестирование для валидации MLOps.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل Python التي تحتاج إلى كتابة صارمة وتحقق موحد واختبار شاملة للتحقق من صحة MLOps."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce software quality, reliability, and security through automated validation layers using ty for strict typing, ruff for unified linting, pytest for comprehensive testing, and loguru for structured logging.","zh":"赋予代理人通过自动化验证层强制执行软件质量、可靠性和安全性，使用ty进行严格类型、ruff进行统一lint、pytest进行全面测试和loguru进行结构化日志记录。","ja":"tyを使用した厳格なタイピング、ruffを使用した統一されたlint、pytestを使用した包括的なテスト、loguruを使用した構造化ログ記録を通じて、自動化された検証レイヤーを使用して、エージェントがソフトウェア品質、信頼性、セキュリティを強制することを可能にします。","ko":"ty를 사용한 엄격한 타이핑, ruff를 사용한統一された 린트, pytest를 사용한 포괄적인 테스트, loguru를 사용한 구조화된 로그 기록을 통해 자동화된 검증 레이어를 사용하여 에이전트가 소프트웨어 품질, 신뢰성, 보안을 강제할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir la calidad del software, la confiabilidad y la seguridad a través de capas de validación automatizadas utilizando ty para el tipado estricto, ruff para el linting unificado, pytest para las pruebas exhaustivas y loguru para la registración estructurada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''imposer la qualité logicielle, la fiabilité et la sécurité grâce à des couches de validation automatisées utilisant ty pour le typage strict, ruff pour le linting unifié, pytest pour les tests exhaustifs et loguru pour la journalisation structurée.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Softwarequalität, Zuverlässigkeit und Sicherheit durch automatisierte Validierungsschichten zu gewährleisten, die ty für strenges Typing, ruff für einheitliches Linting, pytest für umfassende Tests und loguru für strukturierte Protokollierung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor qualidade de software, confiabilidade e segurança por meio de camadas de validação automatizadas usando ty para digitação estrita, ruff para linting unificado, pytest para teste abrangente e loguru para registro estruturado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать качество программного обеспечения, надежность и безопасность за счет автоматических слоев проверки с использованием ty для строгой типизации, ruff для унифицированной проверки кода, pytest для всестороннего тестирования и loguru для структурированного журналирования.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من فرض جودة البرمجيات والثبات والأمان من خلال طبقات التحقق الآلي باستخدام ty للكتابة الصارمة و ruff للتحقق الموحد و pytest للاختبار الشامل و loguru للتسجيل الهيكلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code quality checks before merge or deploy","Validating Python code for errors using ty and ruff","Generating comprehensive test reports using pytest"],"zh":["在合并或部署之前自动执行代码质量检查","使用ty和ruff验证Python代码中的错误","使用pytest生成全面测试报告"],"ja":["マージまたはデプロイ前に自動的にコード品質チェックを実行する","tyとruffを使用してPythonコードのエラーを検証する","pytestを使用して包括的なテストレポートを生成する"],"ko":["병합 또는 배포 전에 자동으로 코드 품질 검사를 실행하는 것","ty와 ruff를 사용하여 Python 코드의 오류를 검증하는 것","pytest를 사용하여 포괄적인 테스트 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de calidad de código antes de la fusión o implementación","Validar el código Python para errores utilizando ty y ruff","Generar informes de pruebas exhaustivas utilizando pytest"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de la qualité du code avant la fusion ou le déploiement","Valider le code Python pour les erreurs en utilisant ty et ruff","Générer des rapports de tests exhaustifs en utilisant pytest"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Qualitätsprüfungen vor dem Merge oder der Bereitstellung","Überprüfen des Python-Codes auf Fehler mit ty und ruff","Erstellen von umfassenden Testberichten mit pytest"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de qualidade de código antes da mesclagem ou implantação","Validar código Python para erros usando ty e ruff","Gerar relatórios de teste abrangentes usando pytest"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки качества кода перед слиянием или развертыванием","Проверить код Python на ошибки с использованием ty и ruff","Генерировать всесторонние отчеты о тестировании с использованием pytest"],"ar":["أتمتة فحص جودة الكود قبل الدمج أو النشر","التحقق من صحة كود Python للأخطاء باستخدام ty و ruff","توليد تقارير اختبار شاملة باستخدام pytest"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python projects","Dependent on uv manager"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限Python项目","依赖于uv manager"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Pythonプロジェクトのみ","uvマネージャーに依存"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Python 프로젝트만 해당","uv 매니저에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python","Limitado a proyectos Python","Dependiente del administrador uv"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux projets Python","Dépendant du gestionnaire uv"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Python-Projekte","Abhängig vom uv-Manager"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado a projetos Python","Dependente do gerenciador uv"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен проектами Python","Зависит от менеджера uv"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بمشاريع Python","يعتمد على مدير uv"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f82efd618caac04d611ddd7caa57996b3856a08e7df8e69c0bc400b076b31fb8","qualityScore":60}');
