ьного управления тикетами","ar":"linear-sop هو منهجية تطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متعددة تم التحقق منها للإنتاج، يوفر إرشادات لإدارة التذاكر بانتظام"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"linear-sop: SAFe Multi-Agent Development Methodology for ...","zh":"Linear SOP Setup Guide: AI Tools forSAFe多代理开发","ja":"Linear SOPセットアップガイド: AIエージェントによるSAFeマルチエージェント開発","ko":"Linear SOP 설정 가이드: AI 에이전트를 사용한 SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발","es":"Guía de Configuración de linear-sop para Agentes de Intel...","fr":"Guide de Configuration de linear-sop pour les Agents IA","de":"Konfigurationsleitfaden für linear-sop bei KI-Agents","pt":"Guia de Configuração do linear-sop para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Настройка linear-sop: Руководство для Разработчиков ИИ Аг...","ar":"دليل إعداد linear-sop للبرمجة مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient Linear ticket management with linear-sop. Get the complete whitepaper, working template, and evidence templates for dev/staging/UAT policy. ...","zh":"使用Linear SOP Skill实现SAFe多代理开发，包括Claude Code和11个角色，提供完整的白皮书和工作模板","ja":"Linear SOP Skillを使用してSAFeマルチエージェント開発を実現し、Claude Codeと11の役割を含み、完全な白書と作業テンプレートを提供","ko":"Linear SOP Skill을 사용하여 SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발을 구현하고, Claude Code와 11개의 역할을 포함하며, 완전한 백서와 작업 템플릿을 제공","es":"Aprende a configurar linear-sop para una gestión de tickets consistente y eficiente con nuestra guía paso a paso para desarrolladores","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer linear-sop pour une gestion de tickets cohérente et efficace avec notre guide étape par étape pour les développeurs","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie linear-sop für eine konsistente und effiziente Ticketverwaltung konfigurieren können, mit unserer Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung für Ent...","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o linear-sop para gerenciar tickets de forma eficiente com a metodologia SAFe e Claude Code","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить linear-sop для эффективного управления тикетами с помощью методологии SAFe и Claude Code для ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد linear-sop ل управления التذاكر بفعالية مع منهجية SAFe و Claude Code لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"linear-sop is a SAFe multi-agent development methodology that treats AI agents as specialized team members, providing a structured approach to Linear ticket management and evidence policy.","zh":"Linear SOP Skill是一种用于SAFe多代理开发的生产验证方法","ja":"Linear SOP Skillは、SAFeマルチエージェント開発用の生産検証済みメソッド","ko":"Linear SOP Skill은 SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발을 위한 생산 검증된 방법","es":"linear-sop es una metodología de desarrollo que trata a los agentes de inteligencia artificial como miembros especializados del equipo","fr":"linear-sop est une méthodologie de développement qui traite les agents d''intelligence artificielle comme des membres spécialisés de l''équipe","de":"linear-sop ist eine Entwicklungsmethodik, die KI-Agents als spezialisierte Teammitglieder behandelt","pt":"O linear-sop é uma metodologia de desenvolvimento que trata agentes de IA como membros especializados da equipe","ru":"Linear-sop - это методология разработки, рассматривающая ИИ агентов как специализированных членов команды","ar":"linear-sop هو منهجية تطوير تعامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي كأعضاء متخصصين في الفريق"},"features":{"en":["Provides a complete whitepaper for SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Includes a working template for Linear ticket management","Supports evidence templates for dev/staging/UAT policy","Enables parsing of acceptance criteria and working with UUIDs and issue IDs","Guides consistent Linear ticket management using the Linear web UI or CLI"],"zh":["支持SAFe多代理开发","包含Claude Code和11个角色","提供完整的白皮书和工作模板","用于指导一致的Linear票务管理","支持UUID和问题ID解析","支持Gemini CLI和Linear Web UI"],"ja":["SAFeマルチエージェント開発をサポート","Claude Codeと11の役割を含む","完全な白書と作業テンプレートを提供","一貫したLinearチケット管理を支援","UUIDと問題IDの解析をサポート","Gemini CLIとLinear Web UIをサポート"],"ko":["SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발을 지원","Claude Code와 11개의 역할을 포함","완전한 백서와 작업 템플릿을 제공","일관된 Linear 티켓 관리를 지원","UUID와 문제 ID의 해석을 지원","Gemini CLI와 Linear Web UI를 지원"],"es":["Metodología de desarrollo de agentes múltiples validada para la producción","Plantillas de evidencia para la política de evidencia dev/staging/UAT","Integración con Claude Code","Compatibilidad con UUID y IDs de problema","Proceso manual de operaciones lineales a través de la interfaz web o CLI de Linear"],"fr":["Méthodologie de développement d''agents multiples validée pour la production","Modèles de preuve pour la politique de preuve dev/staging/UAT","Intégration avec Claude Code","Compatibilité avec les UUID et les IDs de problème","Processus manuel d''opérations linéaires via l''interface web ou la CLI de Linear"],"de":["Für die Produktion validierte Mehragenten-Entwicklungsmethodik","Beweisvorlagen für die dev/staging/UAT-Beweispolitik","Integration mit Claude Code","Kompatibilität mit UUID und Problem-IDs","Manueller Prozess für lineare Operationen über die Web- oder CLI-Schnittstelle von Linear"],"pt":["Metodologia SAFe para desenvolvimento de agentes multi-IA","Integração com Claude Code para gerenciar tickets","11 funções de agentes especializados, incluindo BSA, Arquiteto e QAS","Modelo de trabalho para gerenciar tickets de forma consistente","Suporte para UUIDs e IDs de issues"],"ru":["Методология SAFe для разработки многоагентных ИИ систем","Интеграция с Claude Code для управления тикетами","11 ролей специализированных агентов, включая BSA, Архитектор и QAS","Рабочая модель для последовательного управления тикетами","Поддержка UUID и ID тикетов"],"ar":["منهجية SAFe لتطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متعددة","التكامل مع Claude Code لإدارة التذاكر","11 دورة وكلاء متخصصين، بما في ذلك BSA و architekt و QAS","نموذج عمل لإدارة التذاكر بانتظام","دعم UUIDs و IDs للتذاكر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use linear-sop","linear-sop setup guide","SAFe multi-agent development methodology","Linear ticket management","linear-sop alternative","linear-sop vs Gemini CLI","what is linear-sop","linear-sop install","linear-sop for AI agents"],"zh":["Linear SOP","SAFe多代理开发","AI Tools","Claude Code","Linear票务管理","UUID解析","Gemini CLI","Linear Web UI"],"ja":["Linear SOP","SAFeマルチエージェント開発","AIエージェント","Claude Code","Linearチケット管理","UUID解析","Gemini CLI","Linear Web UI"],"ko":["Linear SOP","SAFe 멀티 에이전트 개발","AI 에이전트","Claude Code","Linear 티켓 관리","UUID 해석","Gemini CLI","Linear Web UI"],"es":["linear-sop","agentes de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de agentes múltiples","metodología de desarrollo","Claude Code","gestión de tickets","evidencia dev/staging/UAT","UUID","IDs de problema"],"fr":["linear-sop","agents d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''agents multiples","méthodologie de développement","Claude Code","gestion de tickets","preuve dev/staging/UAT","UUID","IDs de problème"],"de":["linear-sop","KI-Agents","Mehragenten-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsmethodik","Claude Code","Ticketverwaltung","Beweis dev/staging/UAT","UUID","Problem-IDs"],"pt":["linear-sop","metodologia SAFe","desenvolvimento de agentes multi-IA","Claude Code","gerenciamento de tickets","UUID","IDs de issues","BSA","Arquiteto","QAS"],"ru":["linear-sop","методология SAFe","разработка многоагентных ИИ систем","Claude Code","управление тикетами","UUID","ID тикетов","BSA","Архитектор","QAS","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["linear-sop","منهجية SAFe","تطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متعددة","Claude Code","إدارة التذاكر","UUID","IDs للتذاكر","BSA","معماري","QAS","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"safe-agentic-workflow","repoPath":"bybren-llc/safe-agentic-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.564Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"linear-sop","description":"Linear ticket management best practices. Use when creating issues, updating status, or attaching evidence. Provides evidence templates for dev/staging/done phases.","bodyPreview":"# Linear SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide consistent Linear ticket management. Provides evidence templates for the mandatory dev/staging/UAT evidence policy.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new Linear issues\n- Updating ticket status\n- Attaching evidence to tickets\n- Parsing acceptance criteria\n- Working with UUIDs and issue IDs\n\n## Linear Operations (Manual Process)\n\nSince Gemini CLI doesn''t have native Linear integration, use the Linear web UI or CLI for these operations:\n\n### Reading Issue","body":"# Linear SOP Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide consistent Linear ticket management. Provides evidence templates for the mandatory dev/staging/UAT evidence policy.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Creating new Linear issues\n- Updating ticket status\n- Attaching evidence to tickets\n- Parsing acceptance criteria\n- Working with UUIDs and issue IDs\n\n## Linear Operations (Manual Process)\n\nSince Gemini CLI doesn''t have native Linear integration, use the Linear web UI or CLI for these operations:\n\n### Reading Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI\n# Navigate to: https://linear.app/team/{{PROJECT_TEAM_NAME}}/issue/{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX\n\n# Or use Linear CLI if installed\nlinear issue view {{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX\n```\n\n### Creating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Click \"New Issue\" or press C\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue create --title \"feat(scope): description\" --team {{PROJECT_TEAM_NAME}}\n```\n\n### Updating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Open issue and update status\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue update {{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX --state \"Done\"\n```\n\n### Adding Comments\n\n```bash\n# Via Linear Web UI: Open issue and add comment\n# Or use Linear CLI:\nlinear issue comment {{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX \"**Dev Evidence**\\n\\n...\"\n```\n\n## Evidence Policy (MUST)\n\nEvery issue requires evidence at each phase:\n\n| Phase       | Required? | Content                 |\n| ----------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| **Dev**     | MUST      | Implementation proof    |\n| **Staging** | MUST      | UAT validation (or N/A) |\n| **Done**    | MUST      | Final verification      |\n\n## Evidence Templates\n\n### Dev Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Dev Evidence**\n\n**PR**: https://github.com/{{ORG_NAME}}/{{REPO_NAME}}/pull/XXX\n**Commit**: [short-hash]\n**Branch**: {{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX-description\n\n**Implementation:**\n\n- [x] Feature implemented\n- [x] Tests passing\n- [x] Lint passing\n\n**Verification:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nyarn ci:validate\n\n# Output: All checks passed\n\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n### Staging/UAT Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Staging Evidence**\n\n**Environment**: Pop OS dev server\n**URL**: http://pop-os:3000\n\n**Validation Steps:**\n\n1. Deployed to staging: [timestamp]\n2. Smoke test passed: [yes/no]\n3. Feature verified: [description]\n\n**UAT Status:** [Passed/Pending/N/A]\n\nIf N/A, reason: [e.g., \"Dev tooling only - no user-facing changes\"]\n```\n\n### Done Evidence Template\n\n```markdown\n**Done Evidence**\n\n**PR Merged**: https://github.com/{{ORG_NAME}}/{{REPO_NAME}}/pull/XXX\n**Merge Commit**: [hash]\n\n**Final Checklist:**\n\n- [x] All acceptance criteria met\n- [x] Documentation updated (if applicable)\n- [x] No regressions detected\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Parsing\n\nWhen reading issue descriptions, extract ACs:\n\n```markdown\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] User can perform action X\n- [ ] System responds with Y\n- [ ] Error handling for Z\n```\n\nConvert to testable checklist:\n\n```typescript\nconst acceptanceCriteria = [\n  { criterion: \"User can perform action X\", verified: false },\n  { criterion: \"System responds with Y\", verified: false },\n  { criterion: \"Error handling for Z\", verified: false },\n];\n```\n\n## Status Workflow\n\n```text\nBacklog -> Ready -> In Progress -> Testing -> Ready for Review -> Done\n```\n\n### GitHub-Linear Auto-Sync\n\nTickets referenced in commit messages (e.g., `[{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-123]`) automatically move to **Done** when the PR merges. Child stories not referenced in any commit message must be manually closed after merge.\n\n**Best practice**: Reference Feature-level tickets in commit messages. After merge, manually close orphaned child stories that weren''t referenced.\n\n### Status Update Guidelines\n\n| From             | To               | When                     |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------ |\n| Backlog          | Ready            | Sprint planning          |\n| Ready            | In Progress      | Work starts              |\n| In Progress      | Testing          | PR created               |\n| Testing          | Ready for Review | Tests pass, UAT complete |\n| Ready for Review | Done             | POPM approval or auto-sync via PR merge |\n\n## UUID Handling\n\nLinear uses UUIDs internally. When working with APIs:\n\n```typescript\n// Issue identifiers (human-readable)\nconst issueId = \"{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-459\";\n\n// UUIDs (API operations)\nconst uuid = \"ef6a5fa0-2b46-417f-8266-dea2d187b10a\";\n\n// Get UUID from identifier via Linear web UI or API\n// The issue URL contains the UUID\n```\n\n## Common Operations\n\n### Link PR to Issue\n\nPRs are automatically linked when:\n\n- Branch name contains `{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX`\n- PR title contains `[{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX]`\n\n### Create Sub-Issue\n\nUse Linear web UI: Click \"Add sub-issue\" on parent issue\n\n### Query by Label\n\nUse Linear web UI filters:\n1. Open team view\n2. Click \"Filter\"\n3. Select label (e.g., \"sprint-1\")\n\n## Reference\n\n- **Agent Workflow SOP**: `docs/sop/AGENT_WORKFLOW_SOP.md`\n- **Linear Documentation**: https://linear.app/docs\n- **CONTRIBUTING.md**: Workflow documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:38.907Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for SAFe-compliant AI Agents requiring streamlined Linear issue management and evidence policy adherence.","zh":"适用于需要简化线性问题管理和证据政策遵守的SAFe兼容AI代理。","ja":"SAFe準拠のAIエージェントで線形の問題管理と証拠ポリシーの遵守を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"SAFe 규격의 AI 에이전트에서 선형 이슈 관리 및 증거 정책 준수를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA compatibles con SAFe que requieren una gestión de problemas lineales simplificada y el cumplimiento de la política de evidencia.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA compatibles SAFe nécessitant une gestion de problèmes linéaires simplifiée et le respect de la politique de preuve.","de":"Ideal für SAFe-konforme KI-Agents, die eine gestreamte lineare Problemmangement und die Einhaltung der Beweisrichtlinie erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA compatíveis com SAFe que exigem gestão linear de problemas e conformidade com políticas de evidência de forma simplificada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, соответствующих SAFe, требующих упрощенного линейного управления проблемами и соблюдения политики доказательств.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتوافقين مع SAFe الذين يتطلبون إدارة مشكلات خطية وموحدة وتطبيق سياسات الأدلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Linear tickets consistently, providing evidence templates and parsing acceptance criteria using UUIDs and issue IDs, while adhering to dev/staging/UAT evidence policies.","zh":"赋予代理管理线性票据的一致性，提供证据模板，并使用UUID和问题ID解析验收标准，同时遵守dev/staging/UAT证据策略。","ja":"エージェントがLinearチケットを一貫して管理できるようにし、UUIDと問題IDを使用して受け入れ基準を解析し、dev/staging/UAT証拠ポリシーに準拠した証拠テンプレートを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 선형 티켓을 일관性 있게 관리할 수 있도록 하며 UUID 및 이슈 ID를 사용하여 수락 기준을 구문 분석하고 dev/staging/UAT 증거 정책을 준수하는 증거 템플릿을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar los tickets de Linear de forma coherente, proporcionando plantillas de evidencia y analizando los criterios de aceptación utilizando UUID y IDs de problema, mientras se adhiere a las políticas de evidencia de dev/staging/UAT.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tickets Linear de manière cohérente, en fournissant des modèles de preuve et en analysant les critères d''acceptation en utilisant des UUID et des IDs de problème, tout en respectant les politiques de preuve de dev/staging/UAT.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Linear-Tickets konsistent zu verwalten, indem es Beweisvorlagen bereitstellt und die Akzeptanzkriterien unter Verwendung von UUIDs und Problem-IDs analysiert, während es den Beweisrichtlinien von dev/staging/UAT entspricht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tickets Linear de forma consistente, fornecendo modelos de evidência e analisando critérios de aceitação usando UUIDs e IDs de problema, enquanto adere às políticas de evidência de dev/staging/UAT.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять тикетами Linear последовательно, предоставляя шаблоны доказательств и парся критерии приемки с использованием UUID и идентификаторов проблем, при этом соблюдая политику доказательств dev/staging/UAT.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة تذاكر Linear بشكل متسق، مع تقديم قوالب للأدلة وفحص معايير القبول باستخدام UUIDs ومعرفات المشكلات، مع اتباع سياسات الأدلة الخاصة بالمراحل dev/staging/UAT."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Linear issue creation with pre-filled evidence templates","Updating ticket status and attaching relevant evidence","Parsing acceptance criteria for new Linear issues"],"zh":["使用预填充的证据模板自动创建Linear问题","更新票据状态并附加相关证据","解析新的Linear问题的验收标准"],"ja":["予め入力された証拠テンプレートを使用してLinearの問題を作成する自動化","チケットの状態を更新し、関連する証拠を添付する","新しいLinear問題の受け入れ基準を解析する"],"ko":["선형 이슈 자동 생성을 위한 미리 채워진 증거 템플릿 사용","티켓 상태 업데이트 및 관련 증거 첨부","새로운 선형 이슈의 수락 기준 구문 분석"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Linear con plantillas de evidencia prellenadas","Actualización del estado del ticket y adjuntar evidencia relevante","Análisis de los criterios de aceptación para nuevos problemas de Linear"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Linear avec des modèles de preuve préremplis","Mise à jour du statut du ticket et attachement de preuves pertinentes","Analyse des critères d''acceptation pour les nouveaux problèmes Linear"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Linear-Problemen mit vorausgefüllten Beweisvorlagen","Aktualisierung des Ticket-Status und Anhang von relevanten Beweisen","Analyse der Akzeptanzkriterien für neue Linear-Probleme"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas Linear com modelos de evidência preenchidos","Atualizar o status do ticket e anexar evidências relevantes","Analisar critérios de aceitação para novos problemas Linear"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем Linear с предварительно заполненными шаблонами доказательств","Обновлять статус тикета и прикреплять соответствующие доказательства","Парсить критерии приемки для новых проблем Linear"],"ar":["تتميم автоматизации إنشاء مشكلات Linear باستخدام قوالب الأدلة المعبأة مسبقًا","تحديث حالة التذكرة وتحديد الأدلة ذات الصلة","فحص معايير القبول لمشكلات Linear جديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear web UI or CLI access due to lack of native Gemini CLI integration"],"zh":["由于缺乏原生Gemini CLI集成，需要Linear web UI或CLI访问"],"ja":["ネイティブのGemini CLI統合が不足しているため、Linear Web UIまたはCLIへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["네이티브 Gemini CLI 통합이 부족하기 때문에 선형 웹 UI 또는 CLI 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de usuario web de Linear o CLI debido a la falta de integración nativa de Gemini CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface utilisateur web de Linear ou CLI en raison du manque d''intégration native de Gemini CLI"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Linear-Web-Benutzeroberfläche oder CLI aufgrund fehlender nativer Gemini-CLI-Integration"],"pt":["Exige acesso à interface web Linear ou CLI devido à falta de integração nativa do CLI Gemini"],"ru":["Требует доступа к веб-интерфейсу Linear или CLI из-за отсутствия родной интеграции CLI Gemini"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة الويب Linear أو CLI بسبب عدم وجود تكنولوجيا متكاملة أصلية لCLI Gemini"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ec8c0845df54b8f9b2d1d8ae2a3a15d6e385e7e3f0a0ac82c30a0c2cbe90aeb3","qualityScore":60}');
