lib, and beautifulsoup4","zh":"qmd-converter 是一个用于转换 PDF 或 EPUB 文件为 Quarto 书籍项目的工具","ja":"qmd-converter は、PDF または EPUB ファイルを Quarto 書籍プロジェクトに変換するツールです","ko":"qmd-converter 는 PDF 또는 EPUB 파일을 Quarto 책 프로젝트로 변환하는 도구입니다","es":"qmd-converter es una herramienta de conversión de archivos que crea proyectos de libros Quarto a partir de archivos PDF o EPUB","fr":"qmd-converter est un outil de conversion de fichiers qui crée des projets de livres Quarto à partir de fichiers PDF ou EPUB","de":"qmd-converter ist ein Dateikonvertierungstool, das Quarto-Buchprojekte aus PDF- oder EPUB-Dateien erstellt","pt":"O qmd-converter é uma ferramenta de conversão de livros Quarto que extrai texto, divide capítulos e gerencia imagens","ru":"qmd-converter - это инструмент для преобразования книг Quarto, который извлекает текст, разделяет главы и управляет изображениями","ar":"qmd-converter هو أداة لتحويل كتب كوارتو التي تستخرج النص، وتقسم الفصول، وتهتم بإدارة الصور"},"features":{"en":["Converts PDF files into Quarto book projects using pymupdf","Handles EPUB file conversions with ebooklib","Extracts text and splits chapters for structured book projects","Manages images and updates configurations for Quarto books","Utilizes beautifulsoup4 for HTML parsing and html2text for text extraction","Requires specific dependencies like pyyaml for configuration updates"],"zh":["支持 PDF 和 EPUB 文件转换","自动文本提取和章节分割","图像管理和配置更新","依赖 pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4、pyyaml 和 html2text","生成结构化的 Quarto 书籍项目"],"ja":["PDF と EPUB ファイルの変換をサポート","自動テキスト抽出と章分割","画像管理と設定更新","pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4、pyyaml、html2text 依存","構造化された Quarto 書籍プロジェクトの生成"],"ko":["PDF 및 EPUB 파일 변환 지원","자동 텍스트 추출 및 장 분할","이미지 관리 및 구성 업데이트","pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4, pyyaml, html2text 의존","구조화된 Quarto 책 프로젝트 생성"],"es":["Conversión de texto de archivos PDF y EPUB","División de capítulos y gestión de imágenes","Actualización de configuraciones con pyyaml","Uso de beautifulsoup4 y html2text para la extracción de texto","Compatibilidad con el entorno pixi"],"fr":["Conversion de texte de fichiers PDF et EPUB","Division de chapitres et gestion d''images","Mise à jour de configurations avec pyyaml","Utilisation de beautifulsoup4 et html2text pour l''extraction de texte","Compatibilité avec l''environnement pixi"],"de":["Textkonvertierung von PDF- und EPUB-Dateien","Kapitelteilung und Bildverwaltung","Konfigurationsupdate mit pyyaml","Verwendung von beautifulsoup4 und html2text für die Textextraktion","Kompatibilität mit der pixi-Umgebung"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos PDF ou EPUB em projetos de livros Quarto","Extração de texto utilizando pymupdf","Divisão de capítulos e gerenciamento de imagens","Atualização de configurações utilizando pyyaml","Suporte à estrutura de diretório mybook/"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов PDF или EPUB в проекты книг Quarto","Извлечение текста с помощью pymupdf","Разделение глав и управление изображениями","Обновление конфигураций с помощью pyyaml","Поддержка структуры директории mybook/"],"ar":["تحويل الملفات PDF أو EPUB إلى مشاريع كتب كوارتو","استخراج النص باستخدام pymupdf","تقسيم الفصول وإدارة الصور","تحديث الإعدادات باستخدام pyyaml","دعم هيكل دليل mybook/"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use qmd-converter","qmd-converter setup guide","quarto book conversion","pdf to quarto converter","epub to quarto converter","qmd-converter alternative","qmd-converter install","quarto book project creation","digital book conversion tools"],"zh":["qmd-converter","Quarto 书籍","PDF 转换","EPUB 转换","AI 工具","自动文本提取","章节分割","图像管理","配置更新"],"ja":["qmd-converter","Quarto 書籍","PDF 変換","EPUB 変換","AIエージェント","自動テキスト抽出","章分割","画像管理","設定更新"],"ko":["qmd-converter","Quarto 책","PDF 변환","EPUB 변환","AI 도구","자동 텍스트 추출","장 분할","이미지 관리","구성 업데이트"],"es":["qmd-converter","libros Quarto","conversión de PDF","conversión de EPUB","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text","desarrollo de libros electrónicos"],"fr":["qmd-converter","livres Quarto","conversion de PDF","conversion de EPUB","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text","développement de livres électroniques"],"de":["qmd-converter","Quarto-Bücher","PDF-Konvertierung","EPUB-Konvertierung","pymupdf","ebooklib","beautifulsoup4","pyyaml","html2text","Entwicklung von E-Books"],"pt":["qmd-converter","conversão de livros Quarto","pymupdf","ebooklib","pyyaml","desenvolvimento de livros","ferramentas de conversão de livros","Guia de configuração do qmd-converter"],"ru":["qmd-converter","преобразование книг Quarto","pymupdf","ebooklib","pyyaml","разработка книг","инструменты для преобразования книг","Настройка qmd-converter"],"ar":["qmd-converter","تحويل كتب كوارتو","pymupdf","ebooklib","pyyaml","تطوير الكتب","أدوات تحويل الكتب","دليل إعداد qmd-converter"]}},"owner":"partrita","repo":"quarto-converter","repoPath":"partrita/quarto-converter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qmd-converter","description":"Convert PDF/EPUB documents into multi-chapter Quarto book projects using Pixi. Use when the user asks to Convert this PDF/EPUB to a Quarto book or Make a qmd book from this file.","bodyPreview":"# Quarto Book Converter\n\nThis skill converts PDF or EPUB files into a structured Quarto book project (specifically targeting the `mybook/` directory). It handles text extraction, chapter splitting, image management, and configuration updates.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Check Environment**:\n    The script relies on `pymupdf`, `ebooklib`, `beautifulsoup4`, `pyyaml`, and `html2text`.\n    **ALWAYS** check if these are installed in the current `pixi` environment before running the script.\n    \n    If you ar","body":"# Quarto Book Converter\n\nThis skill converts PDF or EPUB files into a structured Quarto book project (specifically targeting the `mybook/` directory). It handles text extraction, chapter splitting, image management, and configuration updates.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Check Environment**:\n    The script relies on `pymupdf`, `ebooklib`, `beautifulsoup4`, `pyyaml`, and `html2text`.\n    **ALWAYS** check if these are installed in the current `pixi` environment before running the script.\n    \n    If you are unsure or if the user hasn''t explicitly set up the environment, run:\n    ```bash\n    pixi add pymupdf ebooklib beautifulsoup4 pyyaml html2text\n    ```\n\n2.  **Execute Conversion**:\n    Run the python conversion script. Assume the script is located at `scripts/convert_to_book.py` relative to this skill.\n    \n    ```bash\n    pixi run python <path-to-skill>/scripts/convert_to_book.py <input_file_path> --output-dir mybook\n    ```\n    *(Replace `<input_file_path>` with the actual file path provided by the user)*\n\n3.  **Verify Output**:\n    - List files in `mybook/` to confirm `.qmd` chapters were created.\n    - Check `mybook/images/` for extracted images.\n    - Read `mybook/_quarto.yml` to confirm the `chapters` list was updated.\n\n## Usage Guidelines\n\n- **Input Files**: Ensure the user provides a valid path to a `.pdf` or `.epub` file.\n- **Chapter Splitting**:\n    - **EPUB**: Splits automatically based on internal structure.\n    - **PDF**: Splits based on the Table of Contents (Outline). If no TOC exists, it creates a single large chapter.\n- **Images**: Images are extracted to `mybook/images/` and referenced in the Markdown as `![](images/filename.ext)`. \n    - **Note for PDF**: To avoid redundancy in OCR-ed PDFs, full-page background images are skipped if significant text is extracted from the same page. Only \"real\" images (diagrams, photos, etc.) that do not cover the whole page or pages without a text layer are saved.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **\"ModuleNotFoundError\"**: Run the `pixi add ...` command listed in Step 1.\n- **\"No chapters generated\"**: The PDF might be image-only (scanned) without OCR, or the EPUB structure is non-standard."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:45.664Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Content Agents needing efficient eBook conversion and Quarto book project management.","zh":"非常适合需要高效电子书转换和 Quarto 书籍项目管理的数字内容代理。","ja":"デジタルコンテンツエージェントが効率的な電子書籍変換と Quarto 本プロジェクト管理を行うのに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 전자 책 변환 및 Quarto 책 프로젝트 관리가 필요한 디지털 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Digital que necesitan una conversión de eBooks eficiente y una gestión de proyectos de libro Quarto.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contenu Numérique ayant besoin d''une conversion de eBooks efficace et d''une gestion de projets de livre Quarto.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Content-Agenten, die eine effiziente eBook-Konvertierung und eine Quarto-Buchprojektverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Digital que necessitam de conversão eficiente de eBooks e gerenciamento de projetos de livro Quarto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для цифровых контент-агентов, которым требуется эффективное преобразование электронных книг и управление проектами книг Quarto.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل كفء للكتب الإلكترونية وإدارة مشاريع كتاب Quarto."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform PDF or EPUB files into structured Quarto book projects, leveraging libraries like pymupdf, ebooklib, and beautifulsoup4 for text extraction, chapter splitting, and image management.","zh":"赋予代理人将 PDF 或 EPUB 文件转换为结构化的 Quarto 书籍项目的能力，利用像 pymupdf、ebooklib 和 beautifulsoup4 这样的库进行文本提取、章节分割和图像管理。","ja":"pymupdf、ebooklib、beautifulsoup4 などのライブラリを使用して、テキスト抽出、章分割、画像管理を行い、PDF または EPUB ファイルを構造化された Quarto 本プロジェクトに変換する機能をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"pymupdf, ebooklib, beautifulsoup4などの 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 추출, 장 분할, 이미지 관리 등을 수행하여 PDF 또는 EPUB 파일을 구조화된 Quarto 책 프로젝트로 변환하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar archivos PDF o EPUB en proyectos de libro Quarto estructurados, aprovechando bibliotecas como pymupdf, ebooklib y beautifulsoup4 para la extracción de texto, división de capítulos y administración de imágenes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des fichiers PDF ou