ndlebarsテンプレートエンジンを使用するための技術文書です","ko":"템플릿 변수 참조는 Overcut의 Handlebars 템플릿 엔진을 사용하는 방법에 대한 기술 문서입니다","es":"Las variables de plantilla son valores que se resuelven en tiempo de ejecución en Overcut, utilizando Handlebars como motor de plantillas","fr":"Les variables de modèle sont des valeurs qui sont résolues à l''exécution dans Overcut, en utilisant Handlebars comme moteur de modèles","de":"Template-Variablen sind Werte, die zur Laufzeit in Overcut aufgelöst werden, wobei Handlebars als Template-Engine verwendet wird","pt":"Variáveis de modelo são espaços reservados que são substituídos por valores reais em tempo de execução","ru":"Шаблонные переменные - это заполнители, которые заменяются фактическими значениями во время выполнения","ar":"متغيرات القالب هي محليات يتم استبدالها بقيم فعliche في وقت التشغيل"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes Handlebars as its template engine","Resolves templates in step params fields at runtime","Supports infrastructure steps like git.clone and repo.identify","Produces structured output for reference","Allows referencing entire output object using {{outputs.step-id}} syntax"],"zh":["使用Handlebars模板引擎","支持基础结构步骤的输出引用","允许在步骤参数中使用模板变量","实现动态输出和运行时解析","支持输出语法和基础结构步骤"],"ja":["AIエージェントのHandlebarsテンプレートエンジンを使用","インフラストラクチャステップの出力参照をサポート","ステップパラメータでテンプレート変数を使用できる","動的な出力とランタイム解析を実現","出力構文とインフラストラクチャステップをサポート"],"ko":["Handlebars 템플릿 엔진을 사용","기반 구조 단계의 출력 참조를 지원","단계 매개 변수에서 템플릿 변수를 사용할 수 있음","동적 출력과 실행 시간 解析을 구현","출력 구문과 기반 구조 단계를 지원"],"es":["Soporte para Handlebars como motor de plantillas","Resolución de plantillas en tiempo de ejecución para steps como git.clone","Acceso a la salida de los steps mediante la sintaxis {{outputs.step-id}}","Compatibilidad con steps de infraestructura como repo.identify","Uso de JSON para la salida de los steps","Referencia a la salida completa de un step mediante {{outputs.step-id}}"],"fr":["Prise en charge de Handlebars comme moteur de modèles","Résolution des modèles à l''exécution pour les étapes comme git.clone","Accès à la sortie des étapes via la syntaxe {{outputs.step-id}}","Compatibilité avec les étapes d''infrastructure comme repo.identify","Utilisation de JSON pour la sortie des étapes","Référence à la sortie complète d''une étape via {{outputs.step-id}}"],"de":["Unterstützung für Handlebars als Template-Engine","Auflösung von Vorlagen zur Laufzeit für Schritte wie git.clone","Zugriff auf die Ausgabe der Schritte über die Syntax {{outputs.step-id}}","Kompatibilität mit Infrastrukturschritten wie repo.identify","Verwendung von JSON für die Ausgabe der Schritte","Verweis auf die vollständige Ausgabe eines Schritts über {{outputs.step-id}}"],"pt":["Uso de Handlebars como mecanismo de template","Referência a saídas de infraestrutura com {{outputs.step-id}}","Configuração de modelos em tempo de execução","Suporte a templates em campos de parâmetros de etapas","Integração com etapas de infraestrutura como git.clone e repo.identify"],"ru":["Использование Handlebars в качестве механизма шаблонов","Ссылка на выходные данные инфраструктуры с {{outputs.step-id}}","Настройка моделей во время выполнения","Поддержка шаблонов в полях параметров стадий","Интеграция со стадиями инфраструктуры, такими как git.clone и repo.identify"],"ar":["استخدام Handlebars كآلية نمطية","الإشارة إلى مخرجات البنية التحتية مع {{outputs.step-id}}","تكوين النماذج في وقت التشغيل","دعم النماذج في حقول معلمات المراحل","التكامل مع مراحل البنية التحتية مثل git.clone و repo.identify"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use Template Variables Reference","what is Template Variables Reference","Template Variables Reference Handlebars setup","Template Variables Reference alternative","Template Variables Reference vs other template engines","Template Variables Reference install guide","Handlebars template engine tutorial"],"zh":["Handlebars模板引擎","Overcut模板变量","AI工具模板变量","模板变量参考指南","Handlebars设置","输出语法","基础结构步骤"],"ja":["AIエージェントのテンプレート変数","Handlebarsテンプレートエンジン","テンプレート変数リファレンス","AIツールのテンプレート変数","出力構文","インフラストラクチャステップ","テンプレートエンジンの設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 템플릿 변수","Handlebars 템플릿 엔진","템플릿 변수 참조","AI 툴의 템플릿 변수","출력 구문","기반 구조 단계","템플릿 엔진 설정"],"es":["variables de plantilla","Handlebars","Overcut","git.clone","repo.identify","plantillas en tiempo de ejecución","motor de plantillas","salida de steps","sintaxis de plantillas"],"fr":["variables de modèle","Handlebars","Overcut","git.clone","repo.identify","modèles à l''exécution","moteur de modèles","sortie des étapes","syntaxe de modèles"],"de":["Template-Variablen","Handlebars","Overcut","git.clone","repo.identify","Vorlagen zur Laufzeit","Template-Engine","Ausgabe der Schritte","Syntax von Vorlagen"],"pt":["variáveis de modelo Overcut","Handlebars template engine","referência a saídas de infraestrutura","configuração de modelos em tempo de execução","desenvolvimento de software com Overcut","guias de configuração de variáveis de modelo"],"ru":["шаблонные переменные Overcut","движок шаблонов Handlebars","ссылка на выходные данные инфраструктуры","настройка моделей во время выполнения","разработка программного обеспечения с Overcut","руководства по настройке шаблонных переменных"],"ar":["متغيرات القالب في Overcut","محرك نمطية Handlebars","الإشارة إلى مخرجات البنية التحتية","تكوين النماذج في وقت التشغيل","تطوير البرمجيات مع Overcut","دلائل إعداد متغيرات القالب"]}},"owner":"overcut-ai","repo":"overcut-playbooks","repoPath":"overcut-ai/overcut-playbooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.635Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Template Variables Reference","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Template Variables Reference\n\nOvercut uses **Handlebars** as its template engine. Templates appear in step `params` fields (especially `repoFullName` and `branch` in `git.clone`) and are resolved at runtime before each step executes.\n\n## Output Reference Syntax\n\n### Infrastructure Steps (git.clone, repo.identify)\n\nInfrastructure steps produce structured output. Reference the entire output object:\n\n```\n{{outputs.step-id}}\n```\n\nExample — `repo.identify` output fed to `git.clone`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"r","body":"# Template Variables Reference\n\nOvercut uses **Handlebars** as its template engine. Templates appear in step `params` fields (especially `repoFullName` and `branch` in `git.clone`) and are resolved at runtime before each step executes.\n\n## Output Reference Syntax\n\n### Infrastructure Steps (git.clone, repo.identify)\n\nInfrastructure steps produce structured output. Reference the entire output object:\n\n```\n{{outputs.step-id}}\n```\n\nExample — `repo.identify` output fed to `git.clone`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"repoFullName\": \"{{outputs.identify-repos}}\"\n}\n```\n\nThe template engine auto-stringifies objects/arrays into readable JSON when printed directly, while preserving property access for nested fields.\n\n### Agent Steps (agent.run, agent.session)\n\nAgent steps produce a `message` field containing the agent''s text output:\n\n```\n{{outputs.step-id.message}}\n```\n\nExample — referencing previous agent output in a prompt:\n\n```markdown\n**Previous step output:**\n\n{{outputs.prep-context.message}}\n```\n\nThis is how steps pass data to each other. The receiving step''s `instruction` can include the template, and it gets resolved before the agent sees it.\n\n## Trigger Context Variables\n\nAll trigger context is available under `{{trigger.*}}`. The exact fields depend on the event type.\n\n### Common Fields (All Events)\n\n```\n{{trigger.repository.fullName}}     → \"owner/repo\"\n{{trigger.repository.name}}         → \"repo\"\n{{trigger.repository.owner}}        → \"owner\"\n{{trigger.repository.defaultBranch}} → \"main\"\n{{trigger.repository.provider}}     → \"Github\"\n{{trigger.repository.description}}  → \"Repo description\"\n{{trigger.repository.workspacePath}} → \"/workspace/owner/repo\"\n{{trigger.repository.customInstructions}} → \"Agent instructions for this repo\"\n\n{{trigger.actor.login}}             → \"username\"\n{{trigger.actor.name}}              → \"Display Name\"\n{{trigger.actor.email}}             → \"user@example.com\"\n{{trigger.actor.type}}              → \"User\" | \"Bot\" | \"Organization\"\n\n{{trigger.trigger.eventType}}       → \"pull_request_opened\"\n```\n\n### Pull Request Events\n\n```\n{{trigger.pullRequest.number}}      → 42\n{{trigger.pullRequest.title}}       → \"Add feature X\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.state}}       → \"open\" | \"closed\" | \"merged\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.baseBranch}}  → \"main\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.headBranch}}  → \"feature/x\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.author}}      → \"username\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.body}}        → \"PR description\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.draft}}       → true | false\n{{trigger.pullRequest.labels}}      → [\"bug\", \"priority:high\"]\n{{trigger.pullRequest.assignees}}   → [\"user1\", \"user2\"]\n{{trigger.pullRequest.headSha}}     → \"abc123...\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.baseSha}}     → \"def456...\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.additions}}   → 150\n{{trigger.pullRequest.deletions}}   → 30\n{{trigger.pullRequest.changedFiles}} → 12\n{{trigger.pullRequest.requestedReviewers}} → [\"reviewer1\"]\n{{trigger.pullRequest.createdAt}}   → \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.updatedAt}}   → \"2024-01-16T14:00:00Z\"\n{{trigger.pullRequest.mergeable}}   → true | false | null\n```\n\n### Issue Events\n\n```\n{{trigger.issue.number}}            → 123\n{{trigger.issue.title}}             → \"Bug: X doesn''t work\"\n{{trigger.issue.state}}             → \"open\" | \"closed\"\n{{trigger.issue.labels}}            → [\"bug\", \"high-priority\"]\n{{trigger.issue.assignees}}         → [\"user1\"]\n{{trigger.issue.author}}            → \"reporter\"\n{{trigger.issue.body}}              → \"Issue description\"\n{{trigger.issue.workItemType}}      → \"Bug\" | \"Task\" | \"Story\"\n{{trigger.issue.createdAt}}         → \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"\n```\n\n### Trigger-Specific Fields\n\n```\n{{trigger.trigger.label}}           → \"security-vulnerability\" (for label events)\n{{trigger.trigger.labelAction}}     → \"added\" | \"removed\"\n{{trigger.trigger.assignee}}        → \"username\" (for assign events)\n{{trigger.trigger.slashCommand}}    → \"review\" (for manual triggers)\n{{trigger.trigger.commentId}}       → \"123456\"\n{{trigger.trigger.commentAuthor}}   → \"username\"\n{{trigger.trigger.commentBody}}     → \"Comment text\"\n{{trigger.trigger.commitAdded}}     → true (for PR edit with push)\n{{trigger.trigger.reviewer}}        → \"username\" (for review events)\n{{trigger.trigger.reviewState}}     → \"approved\" | \"changes_requested\"\n```\n\n### CI Workflow Events\n\n```\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.runId}}        → \"12345678\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.workflowName}} → \"CI / Build & Test\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.status}}       → \"Failed\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.conclusion}}   → \"failure\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.branch}}       → \"main\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.isPullRequest}} → true | false\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.pullRequestId}} → 42\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.commitSha}}    → \"abc123...\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.queuedAt}}     → \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.startedAt}}    → \"2024-01-15T10:30:05Z\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.completedAt}}  → \"2024-01-15T10:35:00Z\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.duration}}     → 295000\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.workflowUrl}}  → \"https://github.com/org/repo/actions/runs/12345678\"\n{{trigger.ciWorkflow.jobCount}}     → 3\n```\n\n**Note:** CI workflow events may also include `{{trigger.pullRequest.*}}` fields when the CI run was triggered by a pull request (`isPullRequest` is `true`).\n\n## Handlebars Helpers\n\nThe template engine registers these helpers:\n\n### Comparison Helpers\n\n```handlebars\n{{#if (eq variable \"value\")}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (neq variable \"value\")}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (gt count 5)}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (gte count 5)}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (lt count 5)}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (lte count 5)}}...{{/if}}\n```\n\n### Logical Helpers\n\n```handlebars\n{{#if (and condition1 condition2)}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (or condition1 condition2)}}...{{/if}}\n{{#if (not condition)}}...{{/if}}\n```\n\n### Serialization Helper\n\n```handlebars\n{{json someObject}}\n```\n\nOutputs the object as pretty-printed JSON. Useful for debugging or passing structured data.\n\n### Iteration\n\n```handlebars\n{{#each items}}\n  {{this.name}} - {{this.value}}\n{{/each}}\n```\n\n## Usage Locations\n\nTemplates are primarily used in:\n\n1. **Step params** — `repoFullName`, `branch` in `git.clone`\n2. **Step instructions** — Reference previous step outputs in agent prompts\n\nTemplates are **not** used in trigger conditions (those use the condition engine with operators).\n\nFor the complete field listing of all context types, see `references/trigger-context-fields.md`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:37.499Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents utilizing Handlebars for template resolution and infrastructure steps like git.clone and repo.identify.","zh":"非常适合使用 Handlebars 进行模板解析和基础设施步骤（如 git.clone 和 repo.identify）的开发代理。","ja":"Handlebars を使用したテンプレート解決とインフラストラクチャの手順（git.clone や repo.identify など）で開発エージェントを利用する場合に最適です。","ko":"핸들바를 사용하여 템플릿을 해석하고 인프라 구조 단계(git.clone 및 repo.identify 등)를 사용하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que utilizan Handlebars para la resolución de plantillas y pasos de infraestructura como git.clone y repo.identify.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement qui utilisent Handlebars pour la résolution de modèles et les étapes d''infrastructure comme git.clone et repo.identify.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Handlebars für die Vorlagenauflösung und Infrastrukturschritte wie git.clone und repo.identify verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que utilizam Handlebars para resolução de templates e etapas de infraestrutura como git.clone e repo.identify.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, использующих Handlebars для разрешения шаблонов и инфраструктурных шагов, таких как git.clone и repo.identify.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يستخدم Handlebars لحل القوالب وإجراءات البنية مثل git.clone و repo.identify."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline runtime execution with Handlebars template engine, supporting infrastructure steps and resolving templates in step params fields, including repoFullName and branch in git.clone, using Output Reference Syntax.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Handlebars 模板引擎来简化运行时执行的能力，支持基础设施步骤，并在步骤参数字段中解析模板，包括 git.clone 中的 repoFullName 和 branch，使用输出引用语法。","ja":"Handlebars テンプレートエンジンを使用して、ランタイムの実行を簡素化するエージェントの能力を付与します。インフラストラクチャの手順をサポートし、ステップパラメーターフィールドでテンプレートを解決します。git.clone の repoFullName や branch を含む Output Reference Syntax を使用します。","ko":"핸들바 템플릿 엔진을 사용하여 런타임 실행을 간소화하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. 인프라 구조 단계를 지원하며, 단계 매개 변수 필드에서 템플릿을 해석합니다. git.clone의 repoFullName 및 branch를 포함하여 출력 참조 구문을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar la ejecución en tiempo de ejecución con el motor de plantillas Handlebars, que admite los pasos de infraestructura y resuelve plantillas en los campos de parámetros de paso, incluyendo repoFullName y rama en git.clone, utilizando la sintaxis de referencia de salida.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser l''exécution temps réel avec le moteur de modèles Handlebars, qui prend en charge les étapes d''infrastructure et résout les modèles dans les champs de paramètres d''étape, notamment repoFullName et branche dans git.clone, en utilisant la syntaxe de référence de sortie.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Laufzeit-Ausführung mit dem Handlebars-Vorlagenmotor zu rationalisieren, der Infrastrukturschritte unterstützt und Vorlagen in Schritt-Parameterfeldern auflöst, einschließlich repoFullName und Zweig in git.clone, unter Verwendung der Ausgabe-Referenz-Syntax.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem a execução em tempo de execução com o mecanismo de template Handlebars, suportando etapas de infraestrutura e resolvendo templates em campos de parâmetros de etapa, incluindo repoFullName e branch em git.clone, usando a Sintaxe de Referência de Saída.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать выполнение в runtime с помощью движка шаблонов Handlebars, поддерживающего инфраструктурные шаги и разрешающего шаблоны в полях параметров шага, включая repoFullName и branch в git.clone, используя Синтаксис ссылки на вывод.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحسين تشغيل الوقت الفعلي باستخدام محرك قوالب Handlebars ، ودعم خطوات البنية وحل القوالب في حقول معلمات الخطوة ، بما في ذلك repoFullName و branch في git.clone ، باستخدام بناء جملة مرجع الإخراج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating template resolution for infrastructure steps","Generating structured output for git.clone and repo.identify","Resolving templates in step params fields at runtime"],"zh":["基础设施步骤的自动模板解析","为 git.clone 和 repo.identify 生成结构化输出","在运行时解析步骤参数字段中的模板"],"ja":["インフラストラクチャの手順の自動テンプレート解決","git.clone や repo.identify などの構造化出力を生成","ランタイム時にステップパラメーターフィールドのテンプレートを解決"],"ko":["인프라 구조 단계의 자동 템플릿 해석","git.clone 및 repo.identify를 위한 구조화된 출력 생성","런타임 시 단계 매개 변수 필드의 템플릿 해석"],"es":["Automatización de la resolución de plantillas para pasos de infraestructura","Generación de salida estructurada para git.clone y repo.identify","Resolución de plantillas en campos de parámetros de paso en tiempo de ejecución"],"fr":["Automatisation de la résolution de modèles pour les étapes d''infrastructure","Génération de sortie structurée pour git.clone et repo.identify","Résolution de modèles dans les champs de paramètres d''étape à l''exécution"],"de":["Automatisierung der Vorlagenauflösung für Infrastrukturschritte","Erzeugung von strukturierter Ausgabe für git.clone und repo.identify","Auflösung von Vorlagen in Schritt-Parameterfeldern zur Laufzeit"],"pt":["Automatizar a resolução de templates para etapas de infraestrutura","Gerar saída estruturada para git.clone e repo.identify","Resolver templates em campos de parâmetros de etapa em tempo de execução"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разрешение шаблонов для инфраструктурных шагов","Генерировать ст